{"id":"n58159-9-4","stage":0,"title":"무겁다 · 身子沉重","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58159-9-4-1","ko":"몸도 무거운데 왜 마중을 나왔어요?","zh":"你怀着身孕，怎么还出来接我？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸도","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸도","audio":"/audio/98f3f0e5200df4876553.mp3"}},{"text":"무거운데","meaning":"身子沉重（因怀孕）","explanation":"무겁다：这里指怀孕使身体沉重、行动不便；-은데 先交代背景，再问为何仍出来接人。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"9","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무거운데","audio":"/audio/660e062ec8e41a071e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"마중을","meaning":"接站，接机","explanation":"마중：接站，接机；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마중","audio":"/audio/810477f1a03c9c2cdb26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54342","senseId":"1","lemma":"마중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마중을","audio":"/audio/77d1188956b3342bf487.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔어요?","meaning":"出来接","explanation":"나오다：为了接人而来到外面或约定地点；-았어요 是礼貌的过去式。마중을 나오다 是“出来迎接”。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"3","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔어요","audio":"/audio/9c894cf2b8ccb1afceae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":[